<title>INDONESIA: Bukaka 1996 net up to 45.44 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bukaka 1996 net up to 45.44 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  45.44   vs   28.50</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rph)     323   vs     203</p>
<p>    Total revenue		    392.27   vs  270.12</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     169.53   vs   78.54</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 142.07   vs   55.31</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		 79.24   vs   43.79</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were audited. PT Bukaka Teknik Utama is an engineering company. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
